            "review_title": "Review at Que Houng Pho Com Vietnamese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Katrine C\n2 contributions\n0\nBest Nem Nuong I have ever had - Authentic cuisine, amazing service and great atmosphere.\nMay 2026 • Couples\nWe were searching for an authentic version of Nem Nuong which we’d tried in Hanoi and knew was a traditional Nha Trang dish. Most restaurants and side street cafes were trying to replicate foreign fare which made it hard to find the real, Vietnamese flavours you come here for.\nLook no further, best of both worlds, they have a great mix of east and west, their local options are soooo delicious, we came back the next night for more. They even changed dishes for us when we asked.\nCannot recommend highly enough, wish I took photos for you!\nRead more\nWritten May 19, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
